{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Approach and take object, check properties, complete task if object approached or scan area if not. Move to next location.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = CompleteSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />\"",
